{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7bb68abc68be3db5","name":"Improved Sleight of Hand","source":{"id":"source:reference-7bb68abc68be3db5","title":"Improved Sleight of Hand","revision":21349,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:38:14Z","sha256":"12b5b7a8daf20c40dc99024a3f3f968fb3b2a70e9851ac279cca2915128092d5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21349","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Improved%20Sleight%20of%20Hand&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7bb68abc68be3db5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You manipulate small objects quickly, and they seemingly disappear with a flick of your wrist. You excel at hiding objects when observed, even at close range.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 15, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Deception)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Deception)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sleight of Hand"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," skill, you can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," skill to improve your chances of success. Prior to making the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". The opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check of anyone attempting to notice your action must exceed both your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check and your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, you can, as a single Action, use Improved Sleight of Hand to simultaneously draw and palm a weapon two sizes smaller than you. Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," when drawing your weapon to successfully conceal it in a position in your hand (or similar appendage), where you can use it on a following Action. Once the weapon is used, you can attempt to palm it again as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
